    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:2e780f63f4172747",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "6043bb24dde7692600c5cd07b3cf391732d518a67be6bd050629952a24e5385b",
      "text": "Days 7–8 · During your stay, the lodge offers excursions such as horseback riding across the plains, bushland and ponds of the Pantanal, walks through its scenic expanses with wonderful photo opportunities, piranha fishing and caiman spotting. Activities are planned by the lodge according to the weather and the season, and start early in the morning, when animals are most active; the local guide shows you the unique flora and fauna of the region. All excursions and meals (breakfast, lunch and dinner) are included at the Pousada Aguapé.",
